From 74faf06f77df83f29e7e1806cd88b2fafc0bbb82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jianyun8023 <yihy8023@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Nov 2025 21:34:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add Prometheus metrics support (ported to Scrutiny v0.9.5)

Source: https://github.com/ibizaman/scrutiny/commit/74faf06f77df83f29e7e1806cd88b2fafc0bbb82
Upstream proposal: https://github.com/AnalogJ/scrutiny/pull/830

SHB previously used this commit as its entire Scrutiny source. Carry its
exporter on nixpkgs' source instead, preserving /api/metrics and metric names.

Porting changes: reconcile go.mod/go.sum with v0.9.5 without downgrading
existing dependencies, and pass the previous one-day aggregation window to
the updated GetSmartAttributeHistory API. Other application code is unchanged
from the original patch, including its existing disk-identity limitation.

---
diff --git a/example.scrutiny.yaml b/example.scrutiny.yaml
index 8d52d5d..0e12c50 100644
--- a/example.scrutiny.yaml
+++ b/example.scrutiny.yaml
@@ -47,6 +47,11 @@ web:
 #    org: 'my-org'
 #    bucket: 'bucket'
     retention_policy: true
+
+  # Prometheus metrics endpoint configuration
+  metrics:
+    # Enable or disable Prometheus metrics endpoint (/api/metrics)
+    enabled: true
     # if you wish to disable TLS certificate verification,
     # when using self-signed certificates for example,
     # then uncomment the lines below and set `insecure_skip_verify: true`
